<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>邮箱验证 - Follow-Flow Puzzle Hunt</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 400px; margin: 50px auto; padding: 20px; }
    .error { color: red; margin-bottom: 10px; }
    input { width: 100%; padding: 8px; margin: 8px 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    button { width: 100%; padding: 10px; background: #007bff; color: white; border: none; cursor: pointer; }
    a { display: block; text-align: center; margin-top: 10px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>邮箱验证</h1>
  <p>我们已向 <strong><%= email %></strong> 发送了 6 位验证码，请查收（10 分钟内有效）。</p>
  <% if (error) { %>
    <div class="error"><%= error %></div>
  <% } %>
  <form action="/verify" method="POST">
    <input type="hidden" name="email" value="<%= email %>">
    <div>
      <label>验证码</label>
      <input type="text" name="code" required maxlength="6" pattern="\d{6}" placeholder="6 位数字">
    </div>
    <button type="submit">验证</button>
  </form>
  <a href="/register">← 重新注册</a>
</body>
</html>